# build time). Public, safe to commit. Its private half is the GitHub secret
# DESCALL_SETUP_SIGNING_KEY and never goes into this repository. How: docs/desktop/anahtarlar.md
# Until this line is replaced, tauri-release.yml skips the setup (manifest, parts, DescallSetup.exe).
